window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>A Why Choose Supernatural Romance</p> <p><b>Something wicked this way comes.</b><br> <br> Sasha is back and she's not alone. An ancient enemy has returned. One that's been pulling strings from the shadows all along.<br> <br> But for every move we make, they are two steps ahead.<br> <br> All my life I've been a broken witch. Cursed to never forget. Now that curse may be the key to my own salvation.<br> <br> If there is one irrefutable truth, it's this—nothing will ever be the same again.<br> <br> <i>Especially me.</i><br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
